      "message": "It actually does two things instead of one thing.\n1. It reads and saves msft opcode from the kernel at the first time in supports_msft_extensions().\n2. It reads the supported features.\n\nIs msft_read_opcode_and_supported_features() okay? (It is kind of long.)",
